      },
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I can see why they switched over to Noto Sans Emojis, probably to just make the Chatbox looks simpler and not end up in a colour explosion. But I do agree they should use a different set of emojis and probably also one that is not just mono coloured.\nI think using Fluent Emojis would be great, they have a 3D, 2D and high contrast version (which is mono coloured).\nhttps://github.com/microsoft/fluentui-emoji",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
